  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Development of the communities of Northern Morazan through sustainable agriculture</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEOF- El SalvadorEl Salvador has taken important steps to increase its population&apos;s basic educational levels, yet access to education that leads to a viable livelihood is still unattainable for many young people, particularly those living in rural areas. Lacking pathways to productive livelihoods, young people sometimes feel forced to turn to irregular migration. The IAF supports community-led solutions to enhance livelihoods, peace, and security. Our grantee partner the Fundacin Perqun para el Fomento de Oportunidades Educativas (PEOF) promotes community empowerment through education, providing educational services and curricula to community organizations in the department of Morazn with an emphasis on education, sustainable agriculture, and market access.This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America</narrative>
  </description>
